text.section:
The following items of shop and other equipment shall be guarded and maintained adequately:

Any gear, sprocket, pulley, fan blade or propeller, or friction device or coupling that has a protruding bolt or nut;


Shafting or any projecting shaft end that is within seven feet of the floor or platform level;


Any belt, chain, or rope drive that is within seven feet of the floor or platform;


Any fly wheel. A fly wheel extending more than seven feet above the floor shall be guarded to a height of at least seven feet;


Any circular or band saw or planer;


Any repair pit, including when the pit is not in use;


Any counterweight; and


Any mine fan, including the approach to any mine fan.
